    <activity xml:id="act-unitary-circuit-demo">
      <title>Constructing a Hadamard-CNOT Bell State</title>
      <statement>
        <p>
          Given the initial computational basis state <m>|00\rangle</m>, trace the action of a Hadamard gate on qubit 1 followed by a CNOT gate targeted on qubit 2 to create the EPR Bell state <m>\frac{1}{\sqrt{2}}(|00\rangle + |11\rangle)</m>.
        </p>
      </statement>
    </activity>

