  <title>Quantum Foundations Summary</title>
  <p>Key operational principles for quantum mechanical systems:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <p><alert>State Space:</alert> Isolated physical states correspond to unit rays...</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p><alert>Observables:</alert> Measurable physical quantities correspond to self-adjoint operators...</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <p><alert>Time Evolution:</alert> Unitary evolution governed by the Schrödinger equation...</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</assemblage>
        ]]>
      </code>
    </program>
  </paragraphs>

